OL,3,GNEWSAEx-trainee PC avoids jail over
OL,4,Achild sex offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former trainee police officer has
OL,7,Favoided jail after pleading guilty to
OL,8,Fmultiple child sexual offences.
OL,10,FZachary Haile, 27, was sending sexual
OL,11,Fmessages to girls he knew to be
OL,12,Funderage while completing training with
OL,13,FWest Yorkshire Police in 2022, Leeds
OL,14,FCrown Court heard.
OL,16,FHaile, from Ossett, who resigned from
OL,17,Fthe force while under investigation,
OL,18,Falso admitted possessing images of
OL,19,Fchild abuse, including 47 Category A
OL,20,Fimages showing the most severe kinds of
OL,21,Fabuse.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
