OL,3,GNEWSAEx-trainee PC avoids jail over
OL,4,Achild sex offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was handed a total sentence of 24
OL,7,Fmonths' imprisonment, suspended for two
OL,8,Fyears, after a judge accepted his
OL,9,F"express and sincere remorse", progress
OL,10,Fwith rehabilitation and the "extreme
OL,11,Fdelay" in bringing the case to court.
